@startuml
title Online Quiz System — architecture (19 Nov 2026)
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
actor "Student / Teacher / Admin" as User
node "Browser" {
  component "React SPA (Vite)" as Web
}
node "Node.js process" {
  component "Express REST API" as API
  component "JWT auth middleware" as Auth
  component "Auth routes" as AuthRoutes
  component "Quiz routes: role checks, timing, grading" as QuizRoutes
  component "Prisma Client" as Prisma
}
database "SQLite (configured local database)" as DB
User --> Web
Web --> API : JSON + Bearer JWT
API --> Auth
Auth --> AuthRoutes
Auth --> QuizRoutes
AuthRoutes --> Prisma
QuizRoutes --> Prisma
Prisma --> DB
note bottom of DB
Source schema uses SQLite. The submitted Test Plan names PostgreSQL;
see DEV-01 in the deviation log.
end note
@enduml
